<title>USA: American resources says to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>American resources says to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>VERSAILLES, Ky. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Resources of Delaware Inc said on Monday its directors had authorized the repurchase of up to $2 million of common stock in market transactions.</p>
<p>The company said the decision was due to the recent decline in the market price of its common stock to a level below its book value.</p>
</text>
